  "contract": [
    "Use existing actual C aligned/convolution, quantizer, pair, pool, operator and vector helpers to construct440 graph bytes. Preserve four-byte gaps74/dc/1a4 rather than importing the portable model whole-buffer clear. Packed pool fields include both native dimension bytes.",
    "Family0 uses the exact immutable private quantizer constants0.0/1.0 without consuming the model cursor. The C quantizer default is equivalent to that private constant pair. Nonzero builder consumes the first model pair and indexes the complete eight-byte width table8/4/8/0/0/0/0/0 for family0..7.",
    "Three additional helpers pack exactly three input bytes, pack four truncated argument bytes with the alternate-pool identity, and return the tail-vector identity. Executor words remain explicit opaque data bindings; no calling ABI or executor body invented.",
    "Native cursor advances are6856 for family0,3808 for four-output nonzero,4368 for eight-output nonzero and3248 for zero-output nonzero. Late tail records preserve native call order15c/174/18c/144.",
    "710 stock/C comparisons cover all1838 native instruction bytes with independent complete graph/cursor/hole/packed-field oracles. All helpers and memory primitives execute as C; no function port is modeled. Cases include all eight width-table indices, input/output overlap with live modified model headers, packed-helper aliases, flags/dimension truncation, active FPSCR and wrapping cursors.",
    "128 complete HR constructor/actual allocator/teardown cases execute both family builders. Mode0/1 completed graph records independently reach the exact ends of6660-word and2979-word canonical resources. All primary/workspace/filter/graph/queue/state allocations return to prior heap top."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Mode6 construction remains the only modeled constructor function below the ordinary HR lifecycle. Its record is preallocated through each real allocator and transferred. Five external system/logging bindings remain in the fixture; ordinary successful cases exercise mode6 only. Fourteen executor identity data imports remain unresolved, so numerical inference is unproven.",
    "The broad resource-range normalizer initially misclassified packed scalar01010e1b as a relocated pointer, producing a false heap difference. The final fixture normalizes only explicitly typed descriptor/remap/coefficient pointer fields, leaves all packed dimension/flag/scale words unchanged, and asserts that eight real scalar/resource-range collisions are preserved. No firmware source changes were made for that instrumentation issue.",
    "Source model resource pointers are normalized only for comparison output/provider traces, never rewritten during execution. Raw graph scalar words and all other memory remain exact comparisons. Readonly resource data is unchanged.",
    "Nonzero family indices outside0..7, invalid pointers, unaligned/fault behavior, concurrency, cold FP activation, caller scratch and private frames remain unproven. High-address wrap cases establish logical record layout rather than a physically valid entire model resource.",
    "The890-unit ld-r composition passes without failures or duplicate strong symbols.879 prior nongenerated source/object pairs unchanged, tested object equals normal object, no writable state added. Eight readonly width-table bytes plus ordinary C shape metadata are data, not executable blobs.",
    "Two family-builder imports are replaced by three deeper opaque executor identity data imports, application75 to76; boot22. Source-plan/cache layout unchanged. Final executable linking/startup, full executor/inference implementation, physical sensor delivery and boot remain open."
  ],
